 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "It's Mary-san. I'm in another world now..."
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "あたしメリーさん。いま異世界にいるの……。"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Atashi Mary-san. Ima Isekai ni Iruno..."
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Naibara Hirokazu moves from Miyagi to Saitama to start university in Tokyo. Not long after settling in, he starts receiving eerie phone calls from an unknown number. A girl’s voice whispers, “It’s Mary-san. I’m at the garbage dump now… I’m the doll you threw away…” Brushing it off as a prank, he hangs up—but the calls don’t stop. Worse, the caller seems to be getting closer.\n\nThe next day, he answers again. “It’s Mary-san. I’m in front of your room now…”\n\nCould it be that Mary-san, the infamous urban legend, has been isekai’d—and now she’s asking for help over the phone?!"
  },
